### C.jet_secp_lookup5_literal.lookup5_index_range
lookup5_index_range
     : forall nib : Ty.tySem (Word.Word (S (S O))),
       and (BinInt.Z.le BinNums.Z0 (lookup5_index nib))
         (BinInt.Z.lt (lookup5_index nib) (BinNums.Zpos (BinNums.xO (BinNums.xO (BinNums.xO BinNums.xH)))))
### C.jet_secp_lookup5_literal.lookup5_digit_source
lookup5_digit_source
